From: N0zoM1z0 <161784452+N0zoM1z0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:20:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Define MAIN's remaining ZUN data in C++

key_delay_groups moves into keydelay.cpp and pfopen's data into the pf
module, for MAIN and MAINE alike. MAIN's sound data (data.c) gets its own
TU after frmdely1, where maine022.cpp sits in MAINE; pf_fn is the MPN
loader's pooled constant; the sound effect tables follow snd_se in a
small TU of their own. th02_main.asm's _DATA is master.lib only now.
